  "rules_from_design": {
    "Motion + Gestures": "yvnty",
    "Button States": "H2tzDL",
    "summary": [
      "Voice is the main control: hold the talk bar at the bottom of the screen (or Space) and talk; let go to send",
      "Two-finger double-tap = talk / pause Pip (Magic Tap); two-finger Z scrub = stop / go back",
      "VoiceOver reads keys as 'Look around', 'Find something', 'Go back', 'Save this spot'; Pip's line is not read twice",
      "Reduce Motion: animations stop; Larger Text: text grows, keys stack to one column",
      "Background: matrix.glsl behind every screen, in the top line's state color (pink, red when something is wrong); brighter while you talk, dim and slow when deafened or paused; still with Reduce Motion",
      "Screen change: slide up 12 px + fade, 180 ms",
      "Top line on every live screen: state glyph (pink, red when something is wrong), state name, rule, → goal",
      "Keys sit on a 1 px grid (Pad); Stop is light, Go/Resume/Done/Copy log are pink",
      "Key feedback: Pressed flips to pink at touch (light haptic + soft tick); Working says what Pip is doing with a pink sweep; Done flashes white with a check for 0.6 s; Unavailable is dimmed and says why",
      "Every live screen ends with the Voice Bar: Hold to talk (pink \"Listening\" while held) · Deafen (pink \"Undeafen\" when on: Pip's voice goes quiet, taps and urgent warnings still play). Listening also has a dock: Places · Setup",
      "Places and Setup close with the pink Done key; Log goes back with Back",
      "Guiding: ON COURSE pulses with each 0.4 s tick; the turn instruction says how far, as a clock (\"Turn left, to 10 o'clock\")",
      "Turning all the way around (bearings, room check, a search mapping the room) shows the 12-block ring; Pip plays a rising note per new direction",
      "Find first turns all the way around (\"Turn slowly\", no target box) and guides the hand only once Pip has checked it's the right thing"
    ]
  }
}
